<title>USA: New York Times February Times ad volume up.</title>
<headline>New York Times February Times ad volume up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Times Co said February advertising volume for the New York Times was up 6.1 percent, adding that year-to-date ad volume had increased 5.4 percent.</p>
<p>The company said February ad volume for the Boston Globe was up 4.8 percent, but even for its regional newspaper group. Boston Globe ad volume was up 7.1 percent for the year while the regional newspaper group is up 1.2 percent year-to-date.</p>
</text>
